Company: {{ $('Start').first().json.company }}

Must-criteria from job posting:
{{ $('Start').first().json.muss_kriterien.map(r => '- ' + r).join('\n') }}

Candidate strengths already identified (treat as DIREKT evidence):
{{ $('Start').first().json.highlights.map(h => '- ' + h).join('\n') }}

Known gaps (candidate lacks these):
{{ $('Start').first().json.gaps.map(g => '- ' + g).join('\n') }}

